        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naabateererra kuba n'engeso nungi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo nu, mwesisanizeege Ruhanga nk'abaana be abagonzibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kurug 29:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.40.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 40:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mweyongere kugonzangana, Kristo nkooku yatugondeze, yayehayo habwaitu ali kihongwa ekirukuboya kurungi kandi kyonzira hali Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obusiihani, obugwagwa bwona, rundi okwegomba okubi tibisemeriire okugambwaho omuli inywe, habwokuba ebi tibisemeriire abantu ba Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleke embazo mbi, rundi embazo ez'obudoma, rundi ez'okusandaara okutahikire. Ebi byona tibibasemeriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu mukimanyiire kimu, nkooku hataroho musiihani, rundi omugwagwa, rundi omwegombi (anyakufoora itungo lye embandwa y'okuramya) arukwija kugwetwa omu bukama bwa Kristo na Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutaikiriza muntu weena kubabiihabiiha n'ebigambo ebitarumu nsa, habwokuba ebi nibyo Ruhanga asigikiraho kukayukira abantu abatamuhurra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahabweki muleke kuteerana nabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba ira mukaba muli omu mwirima, baitu hati muli omu musana gwa MUKAMA; mugendege nk'abaana b'omusana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Nambere hali musana nuho hasangwa ebirungi byona, ebihikire kandi eby'amazima.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwekambire kumanya MUKAMA ebi arukugonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muteetaba omu bikorwa by'omwirima ebitaina mugaso, baitu mubyoleke bwere bwere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba ebi bakora omu nsita, bikwasa ensoni n'okubibazaaho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu ekintu kyona ekirukuturukibwa omu musana kizooka; habwokuba kyona ekizooka kifooka omusana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo kyagambiirwe kiti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahabweki mwerinde muno ebi murukukora, mutaba nk'abantu abataina magezi, baitu mube b'amagezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bak 4:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukozese kurungi obusumi obu mwinabwo habwokuba ebiro binu bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo nu muleke kuba badoma, baitu mwetegereze MUKAMA ebi arukwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muleke kutaamira amarwa, habwokuba galeeta okwenagiriza; baitu mwijule Mwoyo Ahikiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bak 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambere mwesorooleza, muzinire hamu zabbuli, ebizina, n'eby'okuhaisaniza Ruhanga, nimuzinira MUKAMA kandi nimumukugiza n'emitima yanyu yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obutoosa n'omu byona musiimege Ruhanga Isiitwe, nimujurra ibara lya MUKAMA waitu Yesu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Baanyinamaka na baanyinabwenge ebi basemeriire kukora",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mworoberangane habw'okutamu Kristo ekitiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bak 3:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pet 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baanyinabwenge, muhurrege baiba-inywe nkooku muhurra MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba nyineeka nuwe mutwe gwa nyinabwenge nka Kristo oku ali mutwe gw'ekitebe ky'abaikiriza, nugwo omubiri gwe, kandi nuwe Mujuni wakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe ky'abaikiriza nkooku kiremwa Kristo, nukwo na banyinabwenge balemwege bati baibabo omu byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "COL.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bak 3:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pet 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baanyinamaka mugonzeege bakazi banyu nka Kristo oku yagondeze ekitebe kye, yayehayo habwakyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo asobole kukihikiriza amazire kukisemeza naakyogya n'amaizi ago hamu n'ekigambo ky'omurwa ogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo akyereetere omu kitiinisa, kitaina kabara noobu gwakuba mugonya, rundi ekindi nk'eki; kiikale kiri kirukwera kandi kitaina kamogo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasaija nabo nukwo basemeriire kugonza bakazi baabo nkooku bagonza emibiri yabo yonyini. Ogu anyakugonza mukazi we, buli aba ayegondeze wenka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Busaho muntu aranobere omubiri gwe; baitu aguliisa kandi agurolerra muno nkooku Kristo arolerra ekitebe ky'abaikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na itwe tuli bicweka by'omubiri gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.2.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 2:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nikyo omusaija araalekeraga ise na nyina agumire hali mukazi we, kandi ababiri abo bafooke mubiri gumu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu niyo nsita nkuru, ei ndukugamba nti: Neemanyisa Kristo n'ekitebe kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo nu, buli omu omuli inywe agonze mukazi we nkooku ayegonza wenka, kandi n'omukazi atemuga iba ekitiinisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
